"tile_size"}, "name": "tile_size", "label": "tile_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "overlap"}, "name": "overlap", "label": "overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "overlap"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax Music 3\n\nA music generation model by MiniMax that creates complete songs up to 5 minutes long with stable structure and high audio quality. Two inputs drive it: **Caption** (structured music description: style, mood, vocals, arrangement) and **Lyrics** (with `[intro]` `[verse]` `[chorus]` `[bridge]` `[outro]` tags controlling song structure).\n\n### Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Description |\n|---|---|\n| Caption | Music description. Write it in three sections — Global Metadata → Vocal Details → Arrangement. The more specific, the closer the result. |\n| Lyrics | Song lyrics + section tags. Tags are the only executable structural instructions; the lyric text itself only conveys mood. |\n| max_duration | Target song length in seconds (default 120 = 2 minutes; the model supports up to ~300 s / 5 minutes). Longer songs take more time and VRAM. |\n| seed | Random seed for the generation. Keep it fixed to reproduce the same song; change it to get a different take. |\n| Model files | diffusion model / text encoder / VAE.|\n| Tiled decode | Decode the audio VAE in overlapping tiles to drastically cut VRAM usage — helpful for long songs on low-VRAM GPUs. Slightly slower, with a small risk of seams at tile boundaries; turn it off on high-VRAM GPUs for the best quality. |\n\n### Prompt Writing Guide\n\nYou can find an official [Music Caption Rewriter Skill here](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 660], "pos": [1050, 630], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**\n- [minimax_music3_dit_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_music3_dit_int8_convrot.safetensors) # For low VRAM\n- [minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_music3_dav.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_music3_dav.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├── minimax_music3_dit_int8_convrot.safetensors # For low VRAM\n│   │   └── minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       └── minimax_music3_dav.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [440, 680], "pos": [560, 630], "id": 40, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [67], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [270, 110], "pos": [3933.927001953125, 627.2293701171875], "widgets_values": [false], "inputs": [{"name": "on_false", "link": 63, "label": "on_false", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"name": "on_true", "link": 64, "label": "on_true", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [68], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1669.75244140625, 818.7056884765625], "widgets_values": ["Global Metadata\n\n  Mandopop / Pop Ballad（华语流行 / 抒情芭乐），配器取向温暖、偏 acoustic-cinematic。速度徐缓，约 70\n  BPM，整体保持从容的叙事感。调性为温暖的大调，略带一丝苦涩的底色。情绪走向：以孤独而怀旧的乡愁开场——一种安静的牵挂——随后经主歌与副歌逐步累积温度与坚定，在副歌处推向充满希望的高点，最终\n  在尾声温柔地消散。画面意象：远方的故乡、月光、袅袅炊烟、游子归家。制作质感：精良高保真，声场宽阔，低频温暖、高频通透；前奏留白，副歌逐渐铺满、压缩感增强以放大情绪。\n\n  Vocal Details\n\n  单一男声，清澈温暖的男高音（tenor）音色；低声区带轻微气声、亲昵内敛，高音区则转为饱满有力的投射。演唱处理：主歌采用克制的叙事口吻，副歌逐渐转为高亢而富有情感的延音与轻微颤音，传递思念\n  与期盼。副歌处加入叠唱的自和声（三度堆叠），增添合唱般的温暖厚度而不喧宾夺主。人声混音：适度板式混响营造纵深，副歌长音处加轻微 delay 拓展空间感，轻压缩保证动态变化中的稳定性。\n\n  Arrangement\n\n  Intro：仅一架三角钢琴，稀疏的分解和弦，无打击乐，奠定怀旧而静谧的氛围。\n\n  Verse 1：钢琴延续琶音；柔和弦乐铺底轻轻进入；木吉他指弹加入温柔律动；软质刷鼓与底鼓确立心跳般的轻脉搏。\n\n  Pre-Chorus：弦乐轻微上扬；节奏收拢为标准 kick-snare；贝斯进入，向副歌蓄力。\n\n  Chorus：钢琴转为更饱满的柱式和弦；完整弦乐组上扬；鼓组展开，加入踩镲与吊镲；木吉他改扫弦；和声加厚，情绪顶点。\n\n  Verse 2：配器回落到钢琴 + 指弹吉他 + 柔弦，呼应第一主歌但更添暖意。\n\n  Pre-Chorus 2：按前一次重建，加入桶鼓填充。\n\n  Chorus 2：比首次更满，弦乐与和声更密。\n\n  Bridge：织体收薄，只余钢琴与弦乐；一把清音电吉他加入克制的对位旋律，节奏似悬停、亲密而克制。\n\n  Final Chorus：全曲最开阔处——完整乐队、弦乐与和声齐进，饱满却不失温度，作为情感的最终释放。\n\n  Outro：层层剥落，只留钢琴与渐弱的弦乐，收在一个长音上，如远去的汽笛。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [69], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1971.427734375, 1151.480712890625], "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]\n  火车又开过陌生的站台\n  霓虹把整座城市的夜点亮\n  我站在人潮散去的街口\n  忽然闻见老屋后 槐花的香\n\n  [Pre-Chorus]\n  离家时背走的行囊 装不下那句叮咛\n  妈妈的背影 越走越远 越来越轻\n\n  [Chorus]\n  故乡啊 你在月光那一边\n  照着门前那条 蜿蜒的小河\n  故乡啊 别来是否无恙\n  梦里炊烟又起 我在这头 望着\n\n  [Verse 2]\n  这些年学会了报喜不报忧\n  电话那头 总说一切都挺好\n  可有句话 到了嘴边又咽下\n  怕一开口 眼泪就先往下掉\n\n  [Pre-Chorus]\n  他乡的月亮 再圆也像缺了一角\n  回家的路 在梦里走了 千万遍\n\n  [Chorus]\n  故乡啊 你在月光那一边\n  照着门前那条 蜿蜒的小河\n  故乡啊 别来是否无恙\n  梦里炊烟又起 我在这头 望着\n\n  [Bridge]\n  等到某一天 我放下匆忙\n  走回那条 熟悉的石板路上\n  一碗热汤 一盏昏黄的灯\n  原来漂泊再久 也有停靠的方向\n\n  [Final Chorus]\n  故乡啊 你是我永远的岸\n  无论走多远 心都往回转\n  故乡啊 等我回到你身旁\n  再把这一路的思念 慢慢讲\n\n  [Outro]\n  （火车汽笛声 渐行渐远……）"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [47, 44], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [45], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "size": [500, 750], "pos": [2819.234619140625, 343.4291076660156], "widgets_values": ["", "", 222, "fixed", 60, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 43, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 68, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics",